    {
        "text": "Huff...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It didn't go so well with Mr. Czerny, but everyone else in the Afterglow has been nice and easy to talk with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've visited ten or so houses by now, and picked up a few blood samples. Not bad results.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's almost night now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
