    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Junge Frau, I've seen you busy all day long, running to and fro. I bet you're hungry, aren't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How about trying some Afterglow specialties?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Specialties?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Take a look at this. Pan-fried sauerkraut! The aroma, the color!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(A pickled food saut\u00e9ed in oil. The very opposite of healthy.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What, scared I'm overcharging you? Here, this one's yours, free of charge!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't be shy, now, you've been all over the streets checking up on us. This is to thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Oh, I can't turn down hospitality...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you very much, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't mention it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
