    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$farce_intro",
        "key": "$farce_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's wrong? You've only taken one bite. I told you, it's on the house.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not quite hungry\u2014I'll carry on eating later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, have you ever considered adjusting your recipe slightly?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "In what way?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You see, this serving is approximately that of an adult's, but the salt and fat content are at least three and five times the recommended intake respectively. It's more harmful than anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Junge Frau, I've been making this for decades. There's no one buying it who doesn't like it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If I suddenly changed my recipe, my regulars would have my head!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm suggesting it with their health in mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone spending their money here, myself included, is an Infected. A diet so high in salt and fat can only have even worse repercussions on Infected than on the healthy...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll just ask you this one thing\u2014does my food taste good or not?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's extremely delicious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then that settles it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But I still think\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, alright. I know you can't appreciate my craft, I get it. My heart goes out to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, by the way, I'd like to ask a few questions. Can I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Seeing as business isn't exactly booming right now, ask away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, why don't you tell me how business has been lately?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Up to my ears! More and more people out to eat the past few days, probably thanks to the warm weather.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_penrustle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you familiar with everyone who comes to eat?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I am. Every patron of mine's from the Afterglow. I know basically all of them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are they all Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_penrustle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Have there been any who hadn't shown themselves for a while, but came to buy from you again these past few days?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right. Quite a few too, if I think about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Could I ask you to tell me which of your customers that applies to? Where do they all live?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No problem!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Finally... how have you been feeling recently?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean the Oripathy? Fairly regular, nothing one way or the other. But with business good lately, I've been really on top of keeping my stocks up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm guessing you're not too obsessed with music?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, I've never been much of an artist. Don't have as much drive as them. If I can keep my family fed, I'm happy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's all my questioning, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for humoring me! I hope business thrives for you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you, thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But you've still only taken one bite, Junge Frau. Won't you have a little more?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well\u2014didn't I just\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm joking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You doctors put health first, I understand that! But naturally, taste's a priority for us chefs, and doctors by and large, well, they give us some understanding back. What do you say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Erm... I can understand, but I still can't approve.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Just understanding's a good start. We can put our differences aside. Next time you want a bite, remember, come by!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_494_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmhm, mmhm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "left",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": -300,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
