        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_485_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Two portions of minced meat and a slight char on your sauerkraut, yeah?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_485_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Coffee Shop Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_485_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That girl just now looked a little strange. You seen her before?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Coffee Shop Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_485_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She's been all around the streets lately. If I didn't before, I have now. What, are you going to invite her to yours for a cup?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_485_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Coffee Shop Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_485_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You've seen how she's so busy. Probably on some serious business, no chance to have a coffee.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Coffee Shop Owner"
    },
    {
