    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, fr\u00e4ulein!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(What a strong smell of alcohol...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, you, devil!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you are...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You just left my house! You don't remember?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, you're a relative of Mr. Schneider's? You didn't seem to be at home when I made my visit just now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm his son! You sucked my father's blood!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_501_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hibiscus! Hibiscus!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andante"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Andante, not a moment too late. This man here's extremely worked up, and I don't know what he's trying to convey...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Andante? Andante from Rhodes Island! Go tell your boss right now, to send this devil back home, never let her back in the Afterglow!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_501_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That... Just calm down for now. Tell me what she did. It helps me write my report afterward.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andante"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_501_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) I was wondering why you were taking so long to return... head back to the branch office for now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andante"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) I'll observe a little longer. Something's not right here. Maybe what he says can help us out somehow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She sucked my father's blood! Devil! Bloodsucker! You know what that means?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, Mr. Schneider, you may have heard legends about Vampires, but I'm just an ordinary Sarkaz. Fresh blood has no attractive force on me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who said anything about Vampires?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, buddy. What do you say? What's she doing... collecting blood from Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_499_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passerby Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, you! G\u2014Go on!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_499_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I'm busy right now, excuse me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passerby Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gah, some people got no spine...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bro, you\u2014you tell me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_488_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well... I'm not too sure of the details, but I have heard about Casters using Infected blood to do their Arts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suspicious Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_488_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the Spire Casters secretly abducting Infected lately. They're doing about the same thing...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suspicious Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's what I want to hear! This devil's been collecting our blood from all over! That shit's exactly what she's doing!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Collecting the blood of Infected for Arts... Based on what I know, nothing apart from the, um, quote-unquote 'Witch King's remains'...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_496_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_497_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hibiscus's mindless utterance stuns not just the two Infected into silence, but the entire crowd about them who gathered to see what the fuss was about."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_488_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'd... utter the Majesty's name just like that... You really are... all tied up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suspicious Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's it, she has to be! It's what the prophecy said! This devil's going to use Infected blood to blast us all with Arts!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_488_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Prophecy? You mean the one His Majesty issued...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suspicious Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right! That one! We can't let that prophecy come true!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_496_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you say prophecy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meddlesome Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_496_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard there was a prophecy recently, but it was all vague... what did it say, exactly?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meddlesome Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just as curious. You're trying to drive me off based on some prophecy, but I don't even know anything about it. How do you expect me to go, just like that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_488_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't just talk about it out loud. Who can guarantee he didn't leave behind some kind of Arts? Maybe our each and every move is all...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suspicious Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_496_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eek!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meddlesome Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_496_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Th-Th-Th... Then tell us quietly. What exactly did the prophecy say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meddlesome Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) Andante, have you heard similar rumors recently?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_501_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) It rings a faint bell, to be honest, but I never paid any attention to it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andante"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_501_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) Not to mention His Majesty died long ago. And even if he were alive and well, he'd have no reason to leave any prophecies specifically in the Afterglow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andante"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_501_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) People just keep coming...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andante"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_496_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Girlie, I think you should take a hike. There's everything to fear here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meddlesome Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Get out of the Afterglow!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, everyone, don't just trust an unfounded rumor like this!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_488_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rumor?! You have the gall to call a prophecy a 'rumor,' you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suspicious Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_496_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_497_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_499_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, one moment you saying me and the Wi... those remains are 'all tied up,' the next you're suggesting I'm disrespecting him. What exactly are you trying to get at with all these contradictions? What are you inciting?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_488_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The way your sort behave, common sense never applies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suspicious Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_488_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, who knows what a devil like you is up to, coming here to the Afterglow and using your 'investigation' as a cover to steal our blood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suspicious Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_488_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if you *mean* no harm, we can't just ignore the prophecy and let you stay here! Isn't that right, everyone?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suspicious Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah! That's right!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Onlooking Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not sure why you all seem so scared of a fictional calamity taking place here. It's probably 'His Majesty's' name hanging over you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But there's something that scares me more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm scared I won't be able to find an explanation for this incident.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I cower now, then maybe I'd be losing a golden chance to save lives; maybe, I'd leave you all to be endangered just because of my own cowardice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can look at me like a cruel caster using Infected blood for Arts, you can treat me like some 'devil' spreading disaster... I don't mind any of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just want to save lives. Beyond that, I'm not asking the Afterglow for anything else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No more lies! If you don't go, you're here to destroy the Afterglow!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everybody, I don't intend to start a conflict with you here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you truly want me out of sight, I can return to the Rhodes Island branch office for a time, and you can all cool down in the meanwhile. Would that be okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pssh, now you're talking reason\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunken Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_488_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "No!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suspicious Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_488_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where do you think the Rhodes office is? It's here in the Afterglow too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suspicious Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_488_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or do you think Rhodes Island has some special privilege, huh? That you can just take it out of the Afterglow's hands?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suspicious Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_488_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We won't let that happen!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suspicious Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_488_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone with me! Drive this devil away!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suspicious Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_crowdrun",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Some come charging in, some stay motionless where they are, and some choose to turn their backs on Hibiscus, leaving this site of trouble."
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter the choice they've made, Hibiscus simply stands there, not choosing to fight, nor choosing to flee."
    },
